          "description": "Name of an environment variable holding the token, read from the DAEMON process — so it must be exported before `goobers up`, not inside a stage. A name that stages can also see (through runner.envPassthrough or the built-in allowlist) is refused for secrets that must never reach a stage.",
          "examples": ["GOOBERS_GITHUB_TOKEN"]
